<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.31 vs   1.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.34 vs   0.41</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.40 vs   1.19</p>
<p> Sales		   22.09 vs  20.30</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.97 vs  17.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	36.60 vs  27.17</p>
<p> Operating profit    37.99 vs  27.73</p>
<p> Sales		  289.44 vs 245.49</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
